175	## Animations & Transitions
176	
177	```css
178	:root {
179	  --ease-out:    cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
180	  --ease-in-out: cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1);
181	  --duration-fast:   150ms;
182	  --duration-normal: 300ms;
183	  --duration-slow:   500ms;
184	  --stagger-delay:   120ms;
185	}
186	```
187	
188	**Scroll-triggered reveal pattern:**
189	```css
190	.animate-in {
191	  opacity: 0;
192	  transform: translateY(20px);
193	  transition: opacity var(--duration-slow) var(--ease-out),
194	              transform var(--duration-slow) var(--ease-out);
195	}
196	.animate-in.visible {
197	  opacity: 1;
198	  transform: translateY(0);
199	}
200	
201	/* Stagger children */
202	.stagger-children > .animate-in {
203	  transition-delay: calc(var(--stagger-index, 0) * var(--stagger-delay));
204	}
205	```
206	
207	**JS setup for stagger:**
208	```javascript
209	document.querySelectorAll('.stagger-children').forEach(parent => {
210	  Array.from(parent.children).forEach((child, i) => {
211	    child.style.setProperty('--stagger-index', i);
212	  });
213	});
214	```
215	
216	**Intersection Observer (trigger reveals):**
217	```javascript
218	const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
219	  entries.forEach(entry => {
220	    if (entry.isIntersecting) {
221	      entry.target.classList.add('visible');
222	      observer.unobserve(entry.target); // animate only once
223	    }
224	  });
225	}, { rootMargin: '0px 0px -10% 0px', threshold: 0.1 });
226	
227	document.querySelectorAll('.animate-in').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
228	```
